### Eliminar una devolución de orden de un plan de trabajo — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/deleteOrderReturns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "responseId": 1,
  "orderId": 1,
  "workplanExecutionId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/deleteOrderReturns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "responseId": 1,
  "orderId": 1,
  "workplanExecutionId": 1
}

### Validación: sin responseId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/deleteOrderReturns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "workplanExecutionId": 1
}

### Validación: sin orderId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/deleteOrderReturns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "responseId": 1,
  "workplanExecutionId": 1
}

### Validación: sin workplanExecutionId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/deleteOrderReturns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "responseId": 1,
  "orderId": 1
}

### WD-2050: ejecución de plan inexistente o fuera del scope del partner → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/deleteOrderReturns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "responseId": 1,
  "orderId": 1,
  "workplanExecutionId": 999999999
}
